   ],
   "transcript": [
    {
     "start": 0,
     "text": "New moms, this is one thing I wish I added to the nursery sooner. My baby used to wake up so easily, every little sound, every tiny change in the room.",
     "labels": [
      "Sleeping",
      "Bedroom",
      "Hook",
      "Creator narration"
     ]
    },
    {
     "start": 8.0,
     "text": "So we added this fan to the nursery, and honestly, it completely changed how comfortable the room feels.",
     "labels": [
      "Fan controls",
      "Turning fan on",
      "Product hero shot",
      "Bedroom"
     ]
    },
    {
     "start": 13.2,
     "text": "The first thing I noticed was how soft and natural the airflow feels. It doesn't feel like a regular fan blowing air around the room. It feels more like a gentle breeze. It's so gentle, I feel comfortable keeping it by t",
     "labels": [
      "Feeling the breeze",
      "Curtains & windows",
      "Product hero shot",
      "Bedroom"
     ]
    },
    {
     "start": 24.3,
     "text": "On the lower settings, you can barely hear it, and when I want a little background sound, I turn it up and it creates this soft white noise, kind of soothing, honestly.",
     "labels": [
      "Fan controls",
      "Quiet beat",
      "Bedroom",
      "Creator narration"
     ]
    },
    {
     "start": 32,
     "text": "Honestly, it's seriously become one of my favorite things in the nursery. If you're setting up a nursery, I'd definitely add this.",
     "labels": [
      "Sleeping",
      "Bedroom",
      "Offer CTA",
      "Creator narration"
     ]
    }
   ]
  },
